cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the CHILL+ paper and this repository."
title: "ChillPlusReporter: CHILL+ structure analysis for OpenMM"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jiang
    given-names: Xuan
    email: jx736302931@163.com
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/KingOfChuXuan/ChillPlusReporter"
url: "https://github.com/KingOfChuXuan/ChillPlusReporter"
abstract: >-
  A NumPy/SciPy implementation of the CHILL+ algorithm for identifying cubic
  ice, hexagonal ice, interfacial ice, clathrate hydrate, interfacial
  clathrate, and disordered water in molecular simulations, together with an
  OpenMM reporter that records structure populations and the largest ice
  nucleus.
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - OpenMM
  - water
  - ice
  - clathrate hydrate
  - CHILL+
